---
import HeroSVG from '../assets/hero-about.svg';
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<style>
	.custom-hero {
		width: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
	}
	.custom-hero svg {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
		border-radius: 12px;
		box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
	}
</style>

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Building scalable systems that work"
	heroImage={null}
>
	<div class="custom-hero">
		<HeroSVG />
	</div>
	<p>
	    I design and build systems that work and grow with business demands. I'm a consultant, leader, and business partner you can rely on - someone who can deliver.
	</p>

	<p>
	    This site is where I share what I learn about scalable systems, technology strategy, and business.
	</p>
	<p>
        Interested in building systems that scale or discussing ideas? Don't hesitate to <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/dzmitry-malankau" target="_blank">reach out</a>. Let's build something that works together.
    </p>
</Layout>
